{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43118","headline":"雷塘 · 徐振","name":"雷塘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九重城阙悲凉尽，一聚园林怨恨长。\n花忆所爲犹自笑，草知无道更应荒。\n诗名占得风流在，酒兴催教运祚亡。\n若问皇天惆怅事，只应斜日照雷塘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐振","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43118.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43118","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}